1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,470
A waterpark with more than eleven slides is included in your stay, at this all-inclusive resort in Turks and Caicos.

2
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:14,327
It is the Beaches Turks and Caicos, on Grace Bay, in Providenciales, and it is built for families who want everything in one stay.

3
00:00:14,377 --> 00:00:20,096
Ten pools, more than twenty restaurants, and seven hundred fifty-seven rooms, all in one place.

4
00:00:20,146 --> 00:00:24,561
Here is how I would plan your stay, and my honest score comes at the end.

5
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:26,958
Start at Pirates Island, the waterpark.

6
00:00:27,008 --> 00:00:33,746
It covers forty-five thousand square feet, with a lazy river, a splash deck with water cannons, and a pirate ship.

7
00:00:33,796 --> 00:00:38,869
Expedia lists free water park access, and ten outdoor pools, plus a children's pool.

8
00:00:38,919 --> 00:00:44,082
There are four whirlpools too, and a swim-up bar, so the adults can float while the kids slide.

9
00:00:44,132 --> 00:00:48,556
Sun loungers are everywhere, and cabanas are there if you want shade.

10
00:00:48,606 --> 00:00:49,660
Now, the beach.

11
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:54,242
Grace Bay Beach is a five minute walk, with powder-white sand and turquoise water.

12
00:00:54,291 --> 00:00:59,268
Barefoot by the Sea puts the tables in the sand, with breakfast from seven thirty to ten thirty.

13
00:00:59,319 --> 00:01:04,372
Kayaking, snorkeling, and volleyball are on the activity list.

14
00:01:04,421 --> 00:01:05,345
Now, dinner.

15
00:01:05,395 --> 00:01:10,963
Beaches lists more than twenty restaurants, three food trucks, and fourteen bars.

16
00:01:11,013 --> 00:01:13,564
The stay covers meals, snacks, and drinks.

17
00:01:13,615 --> 00:01:19,515
Mario's serves Italian dinner from five thirty to nine thirty, for guests twelve and older.

18
00:01:19,565 --> 00:01:23,768
For a show, a teppanyaki table puts a chef and a flame right in front of you.

19
00:01:23,817 --> 00:01:29,572
Guests rave about the food and service, and one reviewer said every meal was great.

20
00:01:29,622 --> 00:01:31,201
Now, where you sleep.

21
00:01:31,251 --> 00:01:35,225
Rooms have premium bedding, a fridge, and a forty-inch smart TV.

22
00:01:35,275 --> 00:01:38,453
Some look out over the sea through a big arched window.

23
00:01:38,503 --> 00:01:43,038
Bathrooms come with designer toiletries, and some have a deep soaking tub.

24
00:01:43,089 --> 00:01:46,216
Guests rate cleanliness nine out of ten.

25
00:01:46,265 --> 00:01:48,306
Then, the fun part.

26
00:01:48,357 --> 00:01:53,453
There are tennis courts, pickleball, and a gym with fitness and yoga classes.

27
00:01:53,503 --> 00:01:59,303
The airport is a seventeen minute drive, and Expedia lists a free roundtrip airport shuttle.

28
00:01:59,352 --> 00:02:01,441
A few things to know before you go.

29
00:02:01,491 --> 00:02:06,388
Check-in is from three in the afternoon until midnight, and you must be eighteen to book.

30
00:02:06,438 --> 00:02:11,177
Mario's and Giuseppe's are twelve and up, so plan another dinner for the little ones.

31
00:02:11,227 --> 00:02:15,441
The sea decides which water sports run, so ask the beach team each morning.

32
00:02:15,491 --> 00:02:19,240
Cabanas cost extra, and extra-person charges may apply.

33
00:02:19,290 --> 00:02:20,865
So, is Beaches Turks and Caicos worth it?

34
00:02:20,915 --> 00:02:25,147
On Expedia, guests give it eight point six out of ten, from seven hundred sixty-nine reviews.

35
00:02:25,197 --> 00:02:28,746
Four hundred fifty-six of those reviews are a perfect ten.

36
00:02:28,796 --> 00:02:34,295
Cleanliness scores nine out of ten, and location and staff service both score eight point eight.

37
00:02:34,345 --> 00:02:37,595
My honest score is eight point four out of ten.

38
00:02:37,645 --> 00:02:42,696
It is a great fit for families who want a waterpark, a beach, and dinner all covered.

39
00:02:42,747 --> 00:02:45,100
The link is in the description.
